            'While acid and proteolytic activity help in processing food, the surface mucus–bicarbonate barrier, the blood supply and epithelial renewal protect the wall. Linking the impairment of the barrier only to a single food or to stress is not medically sufficient. The presence of the muscle layers in three directions supports both the mixing of the contents and their direction towards the pylorus.',
